Z||000000||Uaana||11-26-2001||04:17 PM||||All,<BR>There is a new virus that has been released called W32.Badtrans.B@mm or simply called the BadTrans virus.  It hit the UK yesterday and is rampantly spreading thought the US.  <BR>This virus spreads quickly, using the infected computers mail systems to email itself out to other users.  It has been rated a 3 (Medium) on a scale from 1-5 (5 being the worst) The most potentially damaging part of this program is the Trojan horse virus that it leaves behind.  This Trojan logs user keystrokes, including usernames and passwords, leaving the user open for potential hacker attacks.<BR> <A HREF="http://securityresponse.symantec.com/avcenter/venc/data/w32.badtrans.b@mm.htmlALl" TARGET=_blank>http://securityresponse.symantec.com/avcenter/venc/data/w32.badtrans.b@mm.htmlALl</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||BC-GT||11-26-2001||10:18 PM||||Excellent, thanks for the heads up bro, get my AV updated every 2 weeks, but it's nice to get it done immediately when these things come along.<P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.imagestation.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
